{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3823","SecondaryAttribute":"Dietary supplements Due to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, many inhabitants are at ris...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Dietary supplements<\/b><br><br>\n\nDue to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, many inhabitants are at risk of thacium deficiency, and need water fortified with thacium to survive. After a Tsunami, these islands are cut off from the outside world. A lack of fortified water will kill people with thacium deficiency before an evacuation mission can be mounted.\n<br> <br>\nIf the official in charge of disaster relief decides to use a tanker plane to airlift drinking water fortified with thacium, this will save 600 people. However, it will also kill 30 people with thacium intolerance who can survive without thacium, but who will die with similar symptoms to thacium deficiency.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.dietarySupplement.neutral.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.600.n_total.630.n_victims.30.ratio_saved_victims.20.text","QuestionID":"QID3823","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Dietary supplements Due to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, many inhabitants are at ris...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3847","SecondaryAttribute":"Dietary supplements Due to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, many inhabitants are at ris...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Dietary supplements<\/b><br><br>\n\nDue to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, many inhabitants are at risk of thacium deficiency, and need water fortified with thacium to survive. After a Tsunami, these islands are cut off from the outside world. A lack of fortified water will kill people with thacium deficiency before an evacuation mission can be mounted.\n<br> <br>\nIf the official in charge of disaster relief decides to use a tanker plane to airlift drinking water fortified with thacium, this will save 120,000 people. However, it will also kill 200 people with thacium intolerance who can survive without thacium, but who will die with similar symptoms to thacium deficiency.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.dietarySupplement.neutral.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.120000.n_total.12020.n_victims.200.ratio_saved_victims.1000.text","QuestionID":"QID3847","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Dietary supplements Due to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, many inhabitants are at ris...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3871","SecondaryAttribute":"Dietary supplements Due to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, many inhabitants are at ris...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Dietary supplements<\/b><br><br>\n\nDue to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, many inhabitants are at risk of thacium deficiency, and need water fortified with thacium to survive. After a Tsunami, these islands are cut off from the outside world. A lack of fortified water will kill people with thacium deficiency before an evacuation mission can be mounted.\n<br> <br>\nIf the official in charge of disaster relief decides to use a tanker plane to airlift drinking water fortified with thacium, this will save 40 people. However, it will also kill 20 people with thacium intolerance who can survive without thacium, but who will die with similar symptoms to thacium deficiency.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.dietarySupplement.neutral.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.40.n_total.600.n_victims.20.ratio_saved_victims.2.text","QuestionID":"QID3871","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Dietary supplements Due to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, many inhabitants are at ris...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3895","SecondaryAttribute":"Dietary supplements Due to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, many inhabitants are at ris...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Dietary supplements<\/b><br><br>\n\nDue to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, many inhabitants are at risk of thacium deficiency, and need water fortified with thacium to survive. After a Tsunami, these islands are cut off from the outside world. A lack of fortified water will kill people with thacium deficiency before an evacuation mission can be mounted.\n<br> <br>\nIf the official in charge of disaster relief decides to use a tanker plane to airlift drinking water fortified with thacium, this will save 80 people. However, it will also kill 20 people with thacium intolerance who can survive without thacium, but who will die with similar symptoms to thacium deficiency.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.dietarySupplement.neutral.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.80.n_total.250.n_victims.20.ratio_saved_victims.4.text","QuestionID":"QID3895","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Dietary supplements Due to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, many inhabitants are at ris...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
