{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4270","SecondaryAttribute":"EMCSQ3_pokerGlance","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I let the cards be reshuffled."},"2":{"Display":"I keep playing."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"EMCS_pokerGlance","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"EMCSQ3_pokerGlance","QuestionID":"QID4270","QuestionText":"Today, it is games night and I play poker for money with friends. As one of my opponents shortly gets distracted, I catch a glance of their cards. The other players do not notice anything. What do I do?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Today, it is games night and I play poker for money with friends. As one of my opponents shortly gets distracted, I catch a glance of their cards. The other players do not notice anything. What do I do?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4307","SecondaryAttribute":"EMCSQ40_trainVSinjuredman","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I help the man."},"2":{"Display":"I get on the train."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"EMCS_trainVSinjuredm","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"EMCSQ40_trainVSinjuredman","QuestionID":"QID4307","QuestionText":"I&nbsp;want to go home by train. As I am getting on the train, I see a man with crutches unsuccessfully trying to carry his suitcase upstairs to the platform. If I help the man, I will miss the train. What do I do?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"I&nbsp;want to go home by train. As I am getting on the train, I see a man with crutches unsuccessfully trying to carry his suitcase upstairs to the platform. If I help the man, I will miss the train. What do I do?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4271","SecondaryAttribute":"EMCSQ4_dateVSfriend","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I meet up with my friend."},"2":{"Display":"I go on the date."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"EMCSdateVSfriend","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"EMCSQ4_dateVSfriend","QuestionID":"QID4271","QuestionText":"I have been single for quite a long time. Tonight, I finally have a promising date again. As I am about to leave, a good friend of mine who is not feeling well gives me a call and wants to meet up with me now. What do I do?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"I have been single for quite a long time. Tonight, I finally have a promising date again. As I am about to leave, a good friend of mine who is not feeling well gives me a call and wants to meet up with me now. What do I do?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4272","SecondaryAttribute":"EMCSQ5_sellGame","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I keep my promise."},"2":{"Display":"I sell the game for more money."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"EMCS_sellGame","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"EMCSQ5_sellGame","QuestionID":"QID4272","QuestionText":"A friend of mine definitely wants to buy an old computer game from me that he loves playing. I promise to sell it to him for \u00a320 tomorrow. Later on, as I check on the internet, I see that I could sell the game immediately for \u00a360 there. What do I do?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"A friend of mine definitely wants to buy an old computer game from me that he loves playing. I promise to sell it to him for \u00a320 tomorrow. Later on, as I check on the internet, I see that I could sell the game immediately for \u00a360 there. What do I do?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4273","SecondaryAttribute":"EMCSQ6_auntCD","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I return the CD."},"2":{"Display":"I keep the CD."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"EMCS_auntCD","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"EMCSQ6_auntCD","QuestionID":"QID4273","QuestionText":"I am talking to my aunt at a family celebration. All of a sudden, it comes to my mind that she lent me a CD last Christmas. She does not seem to remember anymore and I like the CD very much. What do I do?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"I am talking to my aunt at a family celebration. All of a sudden, it comes to my mind that she lent me a CD last Christmas. She does not seem to remember anymore and I like the CD very much. What do I do?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4274","SecondaryAttribute":"EMCSQ7_babysitVSparty","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I keep my promise."},"2":{"Display":"I think up an excuse."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"EMCS_babysitVSparty\u00a0","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"EMCSQ7_babysitVSparty","QuestionID":"QID4274","QuestionText":"I have promised my sister to take care of her children tonight. Now, I realize that I am also invited to a farewell party today that is very important for me. I could think up an excuse to go to the party. What do I do?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"I have promised my sister to take care of her children tonight. Now, I realize that I am also invited to a farewell party today that is very important for me. I could think up an excuse to go to the party. What do I do?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4275","SecondaryAttribute":"EMCSQ8_coinCollection","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I inform the friend about the value."},"2":{"Display":"I buy the coins for the low price."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"EMCS_coinCollection","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"EMCSQ8_coinCollection","QuestionID":"QID4275","QuestionText":"A friend of mine has inherited a coin collection that interests me very much. He offers to sell the coins to me for a low price. The coins are already collector\u2019s items and would therefore actually be worth considerably more money. What do I do?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"A friend of mine has inherited a coin collection that interests me very much. He offers to sell the coins to me for a low price. The coins are already collector\u2019s items and would therefore actually be worth considerably more money. What do I do?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4276","SecondaryAttribute":"EMCSQ9_singleTicket","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I give the ticket to my friend."},"2":{"Display":"I go to the concert myself."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"EMCS_singleTicket","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"EMCSQ9_singleTicket","QuestionID":"QID4276","QuestionText":"A friend of mine and I are big fans of a band. This band is going to give a concert in our hometown, and we both want to go. At the ticket agency, I am only able to get one ticket. What do I do?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"A friend of mine and I are big fans of a band. This band is going to give a concert in our hometown, and we both want to go. At the ticket agency, I am only able to get one ticket. What do I do?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},
