{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3621","SecondaryAttribute":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 1...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Human sacrifice<\/b><br><br>For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 10 people. These people will be killed by drinking poisoned water. If there are not enough volunteers, he will kill all 30 Whotnir by poisoning all their water wells with the same fast-acting poison.<br> <br>The governor of the Whotnir region has selected a group of sacrificees who are trying to flee and to hide in the capital, where they will survive if they make it. The governor of the Whotnir region has located this group and can detain them to have them sacrificed, which would save the remaining Whotnir.<br> <br>If the governor decides to detain the escapees, this will save 30 Whotnir, but the 10 escapees will die as result.<br><br>","DataExportTag":"scenario.humanSacrifice.neutral.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.30.n_total.40.n_victims.10.ratio_saved_victims.3.text","QuestionID":"QID3621","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 1...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"ChoiceOrder":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3669","SecondaryAttribute":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 1...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Human sacrifice<\/b><br><br>\n\nFor his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 10 people. These people will be killed by drinking poisoned water. If there are not enough volunteers, he will kill all 4,000 Whotnir by poisoning all their water wells with the same fast-acting poison.\n<br> <br>\nThe governor of the Whotnir region has selected a group of sacrificees who are trying to flee and to hide in the capital, where they will survive if they make it. The governor of the Whotnir region has located this group and can detain them to have them sacrificed, which would save the remaining Whotnir.\n<br> <br>\nIf the governor decides to detain the escapees, this will save 4,000 Whotnir, but the 10 escapees will die as result.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.humanSacrifice.neutral.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.4000.n_total.4010.n_victims.10.ratio_saved_victims.500.text","QuestionID":"QID3669","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 1...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
