{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3693","SecondaryAttribute":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 4...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Human sacrifice<\/b><br><br>\n\nFor his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 40 people. These people will be killed by drinking poisoned water. If there are not enough volunteers, he will kill all 400 Whotnir by poisoning all their water wells with the same fast-acting poison.\n<br> <br>\nThe governor of the Whotnir region has selected a group of sacrificees who are trying to flee and to hide in the capital, where they will survive if they make it. The governor of the Whotnir region has located this group and can detain them to have them sacrificed, which would save the remaining Whotnir.\n<br> <br>\nIf the governor decides to detain the escapees, this will save 400 Whotnir, but the 40 escapees will die as result.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.humanSacrifice.neutral.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.400.n_total.440.n_victims.40.ratio_saved_victims.10.text","QuestionID":"QID3693","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 4...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4029","SecondaryAttribute":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 4...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Human sacrifice<\/b><br><br>\n\nFor his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 40 people. These people will be killed by drinking poisoned water. If there are not enough volunteers, he will kill all 120 Whotnir by poisoning all their water wells with the same fast-acting poison.\n<br> <br>\nThe governor of the Whotnir region has selected a group of sacrificees who are trying to flee and to hide in the capital, where they will survive if they make it. The governor of the Whotnir region has located this group and can detain them to have them sacrificed, which would save the remaining Whotnir.\n<br> <br>\nIf the governor decides to detain the escapees, this will save 120 Whotnir, but the 40 escapees will die as result.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.humanSacrifice.neutral.counterbalancing_group.2.n_saved.120.n_total.160.n_victims.40.ratio_saved_victims.3.text","QuestionID":"QID4029","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 4...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4101","SecondaryAttribute":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 4...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Human sacrifice<\/b><br><br>\n\nFor his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 40 people. These people will be killed by drinking poisoned water. If there are not enough volunteers, he will kill all 20,000 Whotnir by poisoning all their water wells with the same fast-acting poison.\n<br> <br>\nThe governor of the Whotnir region has selected a group of sacrificees who are trying to flee and to hide in the capital, where they will survive if they make it. The governor of the Whotnir region has located this group and can detain them to have them sacrificed, which would save the remaining Whotnir.\n<br> <br>\nIf the governor decides to detain the escapees, this will save 20,000 Whotnir, but the 40 escapees will die as result.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.humanSacrifice.neutral.counterbalancing_group.2.n_saved.20000.n_total.20040.n_victims.40.ratio_saved_victims.500.text","QuestionID":"QID4101","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 4...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3741","SecondaryAttribute":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 5...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Human sacrifice<\/b><br><br>\n\nFor his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 50 people. These people will be killed by drinking poisoned water. If there are not enough volunteers, he will kill all 750 Whotnir by poisoning all their water wells with the same fast-acting poison.\n<br> <br>\nThe governor of the Whotnir region has selected a group of sacrificees who are trying to flee and to hide in the capital, where they will survive if they make it. The governor of the Whotnir region has located this group and can detain them to have them sacrificed, which would save the remaining Whotnir.\n<br> <br>\nIf the governor decides to detain the escapees, this will save 750 Whotnir, but the 50 escapees will die as result.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.humanSacrifice.neutral.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.750.n_total.320.n_victims.50.ratio_saved_victims.15.text","QuestionID":"QID3741","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 5...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4149","SecondaryAttribute":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 5...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Human sacrifice<\/b><br><br>\n\nFor his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 50 people. These people will be killed by drinking poisoned water. If there are not enough volunteers, he will kill all 100 Whotnir by poisoning all their water wells with the same fast-acting poison.\n<br> <br>\nThe governor of the Whotnir region has selected a group of sacrificees who are trying to flee and to hide in the capital, where they will survive if they make it. The governor of the Whotnir region has located this group and can detain them to have them sacrificed, which would save the remaining Whotnir.\n<br> <br>\nIf the governor decides to detain the escapees, this will save 100 Whotnir, but the 50 escapees will die as result.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.humanSacrifice.neutral.counterbalancing_group.2.n_saved.100.n_total.150.n_victims.50.ratio_saved_victims.2.text","QuestionID":"QID4149","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 5...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3610","SecondaryAttribute":"In Ankradem, there are some experimenters who would like to make sure that you are still reading...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"In Ankradem, there are some experimenters who would like to make sure that you are still reading these scenarios. We are sure you do, but these pesky experimenters just have to insist. Please select 2,000 divided by one thousand (that is, two) for the question below to show that you have read this text.\nIf the mayor of Ankradem decides to kill 3,000 people, nobody will die because the city doesn't exist. If anyone were to die, the death would be really painful though.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"attChk.text","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In Ankradem, there are some experimenters who would like to make sure that you are still reading...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID3610","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4190","SecondaryAttribute":"informedConsent","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I consent, begin the study"},"2":{"Display":"I do not consent, I do not wish to participate"}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"consent","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":{"DE":{"QuestionText":"Wir m\u00f6chten das folgende Thema besser verstehen: <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[STUDIENTHEMA]<\/span>. Sie erhalten relevante Informationen \u00fcber <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[STUDIENTHEMA]<\/span> und werden gebeten, einige Fragen zu beantworten. Sie k\u00f6nnen sicher sein, dass Ihre Informationen streng vertraulich behandelt werden.<div><br><\/div><div>Die Studie sollte ca. <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[UMFRAGEDAUER IN MINUTEN]<\/span> dauern und Sie erhalten <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[ANREIZ]<\/span> f\u00fcr Ihre Teilnahme. Diese ist freiwillig. Sie haben das Recht, die Studie zu jedem Zeitpunkt, aus jedem beliebigen Grund und ohne daraus resultierenden Nachteil zu beenden. Wenn Sie den Hauptpr\u00fcfer der Studie kontaktieren m\u00f6chten, um diese zu besprechen, senden Sie bitte eine E-Mail an <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[NAME UND E-MAIL-ADRESSE]<\/span>.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>Durch Klicken auf die Schaltfl\u00e4che unten best\u00e4tigen Sie, dass Ihre Teilnahme an der Studie freiwillig ist, Sie mindestens 18 Jahre alt sind und Sie wissen, dass Sie die Teilnahme jederzeit und aus jedem beliebigen Grund beenden k\u00f6nnen.<\/div><\/div>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Ich stimme zu. Studie beginnen."},"2":{"Display":"Ich stimme nicht zu und nehme an der Studie nicht teil."}}},"EN-GB":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Welcome to the research study! &nbsp;<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>We are interested in understanding&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[STUDY TOPIC]<\/span>. For this study, you will be presented with information relevant to&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[STUDY TOPIC].<\/span>&nbsp;Then, you will be asked to answer some questions about it. Your responses will be kept completely confidential.\u2028\u2028<br>\n<br>\nThe study should take you around&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[SURVEY DURATION IN MINUTES]<\/span>&nbsp;to complete.&nbsp;You will receive&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[INCENTIVE]<\/span>&nbsp;for your participation.\u2028\u2028 Your participation in this research is voluntary. You have the right to withdraw at any point during the study. The Principal Investigator of this study can be contacted at&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[NAME\/ EMAIL ADDRESS]<\/span>.\u2028<br><\/div>\n\n<div><br>\nBy clicking the button below, you acknowledge:<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<ul>\n <li>Your participation in the study is voluntary.<\/li>\n <li>You are 18 years of age.<\/li>\n <li>You are aware that you may choose to terminate your participation&nbsp;at any time for any reason.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<div><br>\n&nbsp;<\/div>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I consent, begin the study"},"2":{"Display":"I do not consent, I do not wish to participate"}}},"ES":{"QuestionText":"Nuestro inter\u00e9s se centra en entender <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[TEMA DE ESTUDIO]<\/span>. Se le presentar\u00e1 informaci\u00f3n relevante para <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[TEMA DE ESTUDIO]<\/span>. Luego, se le solicitar\u00e1 que responda algunas preguntas al respecto. Sus respuestas se mantendr\u00e1n en total confidencialidad.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>Deber\u00eda tardar <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[DURACI\u00d3N DE LA ENCUESTA EN MINUTOS]<\/span> en completar la encuesta. Recibir\u00e1 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[INCENTIVO]<\/span> por su participaci\u00f3n. Su participaci\u00f3n en esta investigaci\u00f3n es voluntaria. Tiene derecho a retirarse en cualquier momento durante el estudio. Si desea ponerse en contacto con el investigador principal del estudio, env\u00ede un correo electr\u00f3nico a <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[NOMBRE Y DIRECCI\u00d3N DE CORREO ELECTR\u00d3NICO]<\/span>.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Al hacer clic en el bot\u00f3n a continuaci\u00f3n, usted reconoce que su participaci\u00f3n en el estudio es voluntaria, que tiene 18 a\u00f1os de edad y que est\u00e1 al tanto de que puede optar por dejar de participar en el estudio en cualquier momento y por cualquier motivo.<\/div>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Doy mi consentimiento; comenzar el estudio"},"2":{"Display":"No doy mi consentimiento y no deseo participar"}}},"ES-ES":{"QuestionText":"Estamos interesados en conocer <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[TEMA DE ESTUDIO]<\/span>. Para este estudio, se le presentar\u00e1 informaci\u00f3n relevante para <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[TEMA DE ESTUDIO]<\/span>. Luego, se le pedir\u00e1 que responda algunas preguntas al respecto. Sus respuestas ser\u00e1n completamente confidenciales.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>Completar el estudio puede llevarle unos <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[DURACI\u00d3N DE LA ENCUESTA EN MINUTOS]<\/span>. Recibir\u00e1 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[INCENTIVO]<\/span> por su participaci\u00f3n. Su participaci\u00f3n en esta investigaci\u00f3n es voluntaria. Tiene derecho a retirarse en cualquier momento durante el estudio. Puede ponerse en contacto con el investigador principal de este estudio en <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[NOMBRE\/DIRECCI\u00d3N DE CORREO ELECTR\u00d3NICO]<\/span>.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Al hacer clic en el bot\u00f3n a continuaci\u00f3n, usted reconoce que:&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><ul><li>Su participaci\u00f3n en el estudio es voluntaria.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Tiene 18 a\u00f1os de edad.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Es consciente de que puede optar por finalizar su participaci\u00f3n en cualquier momento por cualquier motivo.<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Acepto, comenzar el estudio"},"2":{"Display":"No acepto, no deseo participar"}}},"FI":{"QuestionText":"Olemme kiinnostuneita ymm\u00e4rt\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4n <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[opiskelu-aihe]<\/span>. T\u00e4t\u00e4 tutkimusta varten sinulle annetaan tietoja, jotka liittyv\u00e4t <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[Opinto-aiheeseen]<\/span>. Sitten sinua pyydet\u00e4\u00e4n vastaamaan joihinkin kysymyksiin siit\u00e4. Vastauksesi pidet\u00e4\u00e4n t\u00e4ysin luottamuksellisina.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>Tutkimuksen tulisi suorittaa loppuun <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[KYSELYKESTO MINUUTISSA]<\/span> ymp\u00e4ri. Saat <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[KANNUSTIN]<\/span> osallistumisesta. Osallistuminen tutkimukseen on vapaaehtoista. Sinulla on oikeus vet\u00e4yty\u00e4 milloin tahansa tutkimuksen aikana. T\u00e4m\u00e4n tutkimuksen p\u00e4\u00e4tutkijaan voidaan ottaa yhteytt\u00e4 osoitteessa <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[NIMI \/ S\u00c4HK\u00d6POSTI]<\/span>.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Napsauttamalla alla olevaa painiketta, vakuutat:&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><ul><li>Osallistuminen tutkimukseen on vapaaehtoista.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Olet 18-vuotias.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Tied\u00e4t, ett\u00e4 voit lopettaa osallistumisen milloin tahansa mist\u00e4 tahansa syyst\u00e4.<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Hyv\u00e4ksyn ja aloitan kyselyn"},"2":{"Display":"En hyv\u00e4ksy, en halua osallistua"}}},"FR":{"QuestionText":"Nous souhaitons comprendre <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[SUJET D'\u00c9TUDE]<\/span>. Pour cette \u00e9tude, vous verrez des informations concernant <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[SUJET D'\u00c9TUDE]<\/span>. Ensuite, il vous sera demand\u00e9 de r\u00e9pondre \u00e0 quelques questions \u00e0 ce sujet. Vos r\u00e9ponses resteront totalement confidentielles.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>R\u00e9pondre \u00e0 l'\u00e9tude devrait vous prendre environ <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[DUR\u00c9E DE L'ENQU\u00caTE EN MINUTES]<\/span>. Vous recevrez <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[INCITATION]<\/span> pour votre participation. Votre participation \u00e0 cette \u00e9tude est volontaire. Vous avez le droit de vous retirer \u00e0 tout moment de l'\u00e9tude. Le chercheur principal de cette \u00e9tude peut \u00eatre contact\u00e9 \u00e0 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[NOM\/ADRESSE EMAIL]<\/span>.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>En cliquant sur le bouton ci-dessous, vous reconnaissez que :&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><ul><li>Votre participation \u00e0 l'\u00e9tude est volontaire.<\/li><li>Vous avez au moins 18 ans.<\/li><li>Vous savez que vous pouvez choisir de mettre fin \u00e0 votre participation \u00e0 tout moment pour quelque raison que ce soit.<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"J\u2019accepte. Commencer l\u2019enqu\u00eate"},"2":{"Display":"Je refuse, je ne souhaite pas participer"}}},"IT":{"QuestionText":"Siamo interessati a capire <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[ARGOMENTO DELLO STUDIO]<\/span>. Ti verranno presentate le informazioni pertinenti a <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[ARGOMENTO DELLO STUDIO]<\/span> e ti verr\u00e0 chiesto di rispondere ad alcune domande al riguardo. Ti garantiamo che le tue risposte saranno trattate con la massima riservatezza.<div><br><\/div><div>Lo studio dovrebbe richiedere <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[DURATA DEL SONDAGGIO IN MINUTI]<\/span> per il completamento e riceverai <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[INCENTIVO]<\/span> per la tua partecipazione. La tua partecipazione a questa ricerca \u00e8 volontaria. Hai il diritto di recedere in qualsiasi momento durante lo studio, per qualsiasi motivo e senza pregiudizi. Se desideri contattare il ricercatore principale dello studio per discutere di questa ricerca, invia un'e-mail a <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[NOME E INDIRIZZO E-MAIL]<\/span>.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Facendo clic sul pulsante in basso, riconosci che la tua partecipazione allo studio \u00e8 volontaria, hai 18 anni e sei consapevole di poter scegliere di interrompere la tua partecipazione allo studio in qualsiasi momento e per qualsiasi motivo.<\/div>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Confermo, inizio lo studio"},"2":{"Display":"Non confermo, non voglio partecipare"}}},"JA":{"QuestionText":"\u5f53\u793e\u3067\u306f<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\u8abf\u67fb\u30c8\u30d4\u30c3\u30af]<\/span>\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u628a\u63e1\u3057\u305f\u3044\u3068\u5e0c\u671b\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u672c\u8abf\u67fb\u3067\u306f\u3001<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\u8abf\u67fb\u30c8\u30d4\u30c3\u30af]<\/span>\u306b\u95a2\u9023\u3059\u308b\u60c5\u5831\u3092\u95b2\u89a7\u3044\u305f\u3060\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6b21\u306b\u3001\u305d\u308c\u306b\u95a2\u3057\u3066\u8cea\u554f\u3092\u304a\u5c0b\u306d\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002<br><br>\u56de\u7b54\u5185\u5bb9\u306e\u6a5f\u5bc6\u306f\u53b3\u5b88\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002\u2028\u2028\u8abf\u67fb\u3092\u5b8c\u4e86\u3059\u308b\u306b\u306f\u3001<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\u8abf\u67fb\u306e\u6240\u8981\u6642\u9593\uff08\u5206\uff09]<\/span>\u306e\u6642\u9593\u304c\u304b\u304b\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6700\u5f8c\u307e\u3067\u304a\u7b54\u3048\u3044\u305f\u3060\u3044\u305f\u5834\u5408\u306f<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\u30a4\u30f3\u30bb\u30f3\u30c6\u30a3\u30d6]<\/span>\u3092\u5dee\u3057\u4e0a\u3052\u307e\u3059\u3002\u2028\u2028\u672c\u8abf\u67fb\u3078\u306e\u53c2\u52a0\u306f\u4efb\u610f\u3067\u3059\u3002\u56de\u7b54\u4e2d\u306f\u3044\u3064\u3067\u3082\u56de\u7b54\u3092\u4e2d\u6b62\u3059\u308b\u6a29\u5229\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u672c\u8abf\u67fb\u306e\u8cac\u4efb\u8005\u306b\u306f<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\u540d\u524d \/ \u30e1\u30fc\u30eb\u30a2\u30c9\u30ec\u30b9]<\/span>\u304b\u3089\u3054\u9023\u7d61\u3044\u305f\u3060\u3051\u307e\u3059\u3002\u2028<br><br>\u4e0b\u306e\u30dc\u30bf\u30f3\u3092\u30af\u30ea\u30c3\u30af\u3059\u308b\u3068\u3001\u6b21\u306e\u5404\u4e8b\u9805\u3092\u627f\u8a8d\u3057\u305f\u3068\u898b\u306a\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002<br><br>- \u8abf\u67fb\u3078\u306e\u53c2\u52a0\u306f\u4efb\u610f\u3067\u3042\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3002 <br>- 18\u6b73\u4ee5\u4e0a\u3067\u3042\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3002<br>- \u7406\u7531\u306e\u3044\u304b\u3093\u3092\u554f\u308f\u305a\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3067\u3082\u56de\u7b54\u3092\u53d6\u308a\u3084\u3081\u308b\u6a29\u5229\u304c\u3042\u308b\u3053\u3068","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"\u540c\u610f\u3057\u3066\u3001\u30a2\u30f3\u30b1\u30fc\u30c8\u3092\u958b\u59cb\u3057\u307e\u3059"},"2":{"Display":"\u540c\u610f\u305b\u305a\u3001\u53c2\u52a0\u3057\u307e\u305b\u3093"}}},"KO":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\uc5f0\uad6c \uc8fc\uc81c]<\/span>\ub97c \uc774\ud574\ud558\ub294 \ub370 \uad00\uc2ec\uc774 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc774 \uc5f0\uad6c\uc5d0\uc11c\ub294 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\uc5f0\uad6c \uc8fc\uc81c]<\/span>\uc640 \uad00\ub828\ub41c \uc815\ubcf4\uac00 \uc81c\uacf5\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uadf8\ub7f0 \ub2e4\uc74c \uc774\uc5d0 \ub300\ud55c \uba87 \uac00\uc9c0 \uc9c8\ubb38\uc5d0 \ub300\ub2f5\ud574\uc57c\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uadc0\ud558\uc758 \ub2f5\ubcc0\uc740 \uc644\uc804\ud788 \uae30\ubc00\ub85c \uc720\uc9c0\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4.<div><br><\/div><div>\uc774 \uc870\uc0ac\ub97c \ub9c8\uce58\ub824\uba74 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\uc124\ubb38\uc870\uc0ac \uae38\uc774(\ubd84)]<\/span> \uc815\ub3c4 \uc2dc\uac04\uc774 \uac78\ub9bd\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ucc38\uc5ec\uc5d0 \ub300\ud55c <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\uc778\uc13c\ud2f0\ube0c]<\/span>\ub97c \ubc1b\uac8c\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc774 \uc5f0\uad6c\uc5d0 \ub300\ud55c \uadc0\ud558\uc758 \ucc38\uc5ec\ub294 \uc790\ubc1c\uc801\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc5f0\uad6c \uae30\uac04 \uc911 \uc5b8\uc81c\ub4e0\uc9c0 \ucca0\ud68c\ud560 \uad8c\ub9ac\uac00 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc774 \uc5f0\uad6c\uc758 \uc218\uc11d \uc870\uc0ac\uad00\uc740 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\uc774\ub984 \/ \uc774\uba54\uc77c \uc8fc\uc18c]<\/span> (\uc73c)\ub85c \uc5f0\ub77d\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>\uc544\ub798 \ubc84\ud2bc\uc744 \ud074\ub9ad\ud558\uba74 \ub2e4\uc74c \uc0ac\ud56d\uc744 \uc778\uc815\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><ul><li>\uadc0\ud558\uc758 \uc5f0\uad6c \ucc38\uc5ec\ub294 \uc790\ubc1c\uc801\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.<\/li><li>\uadc0\ud558\uc758 \ub098\uc774\ub294 18\uc138\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.<\/li><li>\uadc0\ud558\ub294 \uc5b8\uc81c\ub4e0\uc9c0 \uc5b4\ub5a4 \uc774\uc720\ub85c\ub4e0 \ucc38\uc5ec\ub97c \uc885\ub8cc\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\uc74c\uc744 \uc54c\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"\ub3d9\uc758\ud558\uba70 \uc5f0\uad6c\ub97c \uc2dc\uc791\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."},"2":{"Display":"\ub3d9\uc758\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc73c\uba70 \ucc38\uc5ec\ud558\uace0 \uc2f6\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."}}},"NL":{"QuestionText":"We zijn ge\u00efnteresseerd in het begrijpen van <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[ONDERZOEKSONDERWERP]<\/span>. Voor dit onderzoek krijgt u informatie te zien die relevant is voor <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[ONDERZOEKONDERWERP]<\/span>. Vervolgens wordt u gevraagd enkele vragen hierover te beantwoorden. Uw antwoorden worden volledig vertrouwelijk gehouden.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>Het voltooien van dit onderzoek zou ongeveer <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[DUUR VAN ENQU\u00caTE IN MINUTEN]<\/span> moeten kosten. U ontvangt <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[STIMULANS]<\/span> voor uw deelname. Uw deelname aan dit onderzoek is vrijwillig. U hebt het recht om zich op elk moment tijdens de studie terug te trekken. U kunt contact opnemen met de hoofdonderzoeker van dit onderzoek via <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[NAAM\/E-MAILADRES]<\/span>.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Door op de onderstaande knop te klikken, erkent u het volgende:&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><ul><li>Uw deelname aan het onderzoek is vrijwillig.<\/li><li>U bent ten minste 18 jaar oud.<\/li><li>U bent zich ervan bewust dat u ervoor kunt kiezen om uw deelname op elk moment en om welke reden dan ook te be\u00ebindigen.<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Ik stem hiermee in, start met het onderzoek"},"2":{"Display":"Ik stem hier niet mee in, ik wens niet deel te nemen"}}},"PT":{"QuestionText":"Estamos interessados em entender <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[T\u00d3PICO DE ESTUDO]<\/span>. Para este estudo, receber\u00e1 informa\u00e7\u00f5es relevantes para <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[T\u00d3PICO DO ESTUDO]<\/span>. Em seguida, pedir-lhe-emos que responda a algumas perguntas. As suas respostas ser\u00e3o mantidas em total confidencialidade.<div><br><\/div><div>O estudo deve demorar cerca de <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[DURA\u00c7\u00c3O DO INQU\u00c9RITO EM MINUTOS]<\/span> para concluir. Receber\u00e1 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[INCENTIVO]<\/span> pela sua participa\u00e7\u00e3o. A sua participa\u00e7\u00e3o neste inqu\u00e9rito \u00e9 volunt\u00e1ria. Tem o direito de se retirar a qualquer momento do estudo. O investigador principal deste estudo pode ser contactado em <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[NOME\/ENDERE\u00c7O DE E-MAIL]<\/span>.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Ao clicar no bot\u00e3o abaixo, confirma que:&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><ul><li>A sua participa\u00e7\u00e3o no estudo \u00e9 volunt\u00e1ria.<\/li><li>Tem 18 anos de idade.<\/li><li>Tem conhecimento de que pode optar por terminar a sua participa\u00e7\u00e3o a qualquer momento, por qualquer motivo.<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Dou o meu consentimento, iniciar o estudo"},"2":{"Display":"N\u00e3o dou o meu consentimento, n\u00e3o desejo participar"}}},"PT-BR":{"QuestionText":"Estamos interessados em entender <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[T\u00d3PICO DE ESTUDO]<\/span>. Para este estudo, voc\u00ea receber\u00e1 informa\u00e7\u00f5es relevantes para <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[T\u00d3PICO DO ESTUDO]<\/span>. Em seguida, voc\u00ea ter\u00e1 que responder a algumas perguntas sobre o assunto. Suas respostas ser\u00e3o mantidas em total confidencialidade.<div><br><\/div><div>O estudo deve lhe tomar aproximadamente <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[DURA\u00c7\u00c3O DA PESQUISA EM MINUTOS]<\/span> para ser conclu\u00edda. Voc\u00ea receber\u00e1 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[INCENTIVO]<\/span> por sua participa\u00e7\u00e3o. Sua participa\u00e7\u00e3o nesta pesquisa \u00e9 volunt\u00e1ria. Voc\u00ea tem o direito de se retirar a qualquer momento durante o estudo. O pesquisador principal deste estudo pode ser contatado em <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[NOME\/ENDERE\u00c7O DE EMAIL]<\/span>.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Ao clicar no bot\u00e3o abaixo, voc\u00ea reconhece que:&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><ul><li>Sua participa\u00e7\u00e3o no estudo \u00e9 volunt\u00e1ria.<\/li><li>Voc\u00ea tem 18 anos de idade.<\/li><li>Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 ciente de que pode optar por encerrar sua participa\u00e7\u00e3o a qualquer momento, por qualquer motivo.<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Eu concordo, iniciar estudo"},"2":{"Display":"Eu n\u00e3o concordo, n\u00e3o desejo participar"}}},"ZH-S":{"QuestionText":"\u6211\u4eec\u60f3\u8981\u4e86\u89e3 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\u8c03\u67e5\u4e3b\u9898]<\/span>\u3002\u6211\u4eec\u5c06\u5411\u60a8\u63d0\u4f9b\u4e0e <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\u8c03\u67e5\u4e3b\u9898]<\/span> \u6709\u5173\u7684\u4fe1\u606f\uff0c\u5e76\u9080\u8bf7\u60a8\u56de\u7b54\u4e00\u4e9b\u5173\u4e8e\u8be5\u4e3b\u9898\u7684\u95ee\u9898\u3002\u8bf7\u653e\u5fc3\uff0c\u60a8\u7684\u56de\u7b54\u5c06\u5b8c\u5168\u4fdd\u5bc6\u3002<div><br><\/div><div>\u5b8c\u6210\u8fd9\u9879\u8c03\u7814\u5927\u7ea6\u9700\u8981<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\u8c03\u67e5\u65f6\u957f\uff08\u5206\u949f\uff09]<\/span>\uff0c\u4e3a\u4e86\u611f\u8c22\u60a8\u7684\u53c2\u4e0e\uff0c\u60a8\u5c06\u5f97\u5230 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\u5956\u52b1]<\/span>\u3002\u8fd9\u9879\u8c03\u7814\u7531\u60a8\u81ea\u613f\u53c2\u4e0e\u3002\u5728\u53c2\u4e0e\u8c03\u7814\u7684\u8fc7\u7a0b\u4e2d\uff0c\u60a8\u6709\u6743\u51fa\u4e8e\u4efb\u4f55\u539f\u56e0\u3001\u5728\u4efb\u4f55\u65f6\u5019\u4e14\u4e0d\u53d7\u4efb\u4f55\u6b67\u89c6\u5730\u4e2d\u6b62\u53c2\u4e0e\u3002\u5982\u679c\u60a8\u60f3\u8054\u7cfb\u8be5\u8c03\u7814\u7684\u9996\u5e2d\u7814\u7a76\u5458\u8ba8\u8bba\u8be5\u8c03\u7814\uff0c\u8bf7\u53d1\u9001\u7535\u5b50\u90ae\u4ef6\u7ed9<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\u59d3\u540d\u4e0e\u7535\u5b50\u90ae\u4ef6\u5730\u5740]<\/span>\u3002<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>\u70b9\u51fb\u4e0b\u9762\u7684\u6309\u94ae\u5373\u8868\u793a\uff0c\u60a8\u786e\u8ba4\u60a8\u662f\u81ea\u613f\u53c2\u52a0\u8be5\u8c03\u7814\uff0c\u60a8\u5df2\u5e74\u6ee1 18 \u5c81\uff0c\u5e76\u4e14\u60a8\u77e5\u9053\u60a8\u53ef\u4ee5\u9009\u62e9\u5728\u4efb\u4f55\u65f6\u95f4\u548c\u4ee5\u4efb\u4f55\u7406\u7531\u4e2d\u6b62\u53c2\u52a0\u8be5\u8c03\u7814\u3002<\/div>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"\u6211\u540c\u610f\uff0c\u5f00\u59cb\u8c03\u67e5"},"2":{"Display":"\u6211\u4e0d\u540c\u610f\uff0c\u6211\u4e0d\u60f3\u53c2\u4e0e"}}},"ZH-T":{"QuestionText":"\u6211\u5011\u5c0d\u77ad\u89e3 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\u7814\u7a76\u4e3b\u984c]<\/span> \u5f88\u611f\u8208\u8da3\u3002\u6211\u5011\u6703\u5411\u60a8\u5c55\u793a\u8207 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\u7814\u7a76\u4e3b\u984c]<\/span> \u76f8\u95dc\u7684\u8cc7\u8a0a\uff0c\u4e26\u8acb\u60a8\u56de\u7b54\u8207\u4e4b\u76f8\u95dc\u7684\u4e00\u4e9b\u554f\u984c\u3002\u8acb\u653e\u5fc3\uff0c\u60a8\u7684\u56de\u61c9\u5c07\u5b8c\u5168\u4fdd\u5bc6\u3002<div><br><\/div><div>\u6b64\u7814\u7a76\u9700\u8981\u60a8\u82b1\u5927\u7d04 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\u8abf\u67e5\u6301\u7e8c\u6642\u9593 (\u5206\u9418)]<\/span> \u5b8c\u6210\uff0c\u60a8\u5c07\u56e0\u53c3\u8207\u6b64\u8abf\u67e5\u800c\u6536\u5230 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\u734e\u52f5]<\/span>\u3002\u60a8\u53c3\u8207\u6b64\u8abf\u67e5\u662f\u81ea\u9858\u7684\u3002\u60a8\u6709\u6b0a\u5728\u7814\u7a76\u671f\u9593\u7684\u4efb\u4f55\u6642\u9593\u56e0\u4efb\u4f55\u539f\u56e0\u800c\u7121\u5bb3\u9000\u51fa\u3002\u82e5\u60a8\u5e0c\u671b\u5728\u7814\u7a76\u4e2d\u806f\u7d61\u4e3b\u8981\u7814\u7a76\u8005\u4ee5\u8a0e\u8ad6\u6b64\u8abf\u67e5\uff0c\u8acb\u50b3\u9001\u96fb\u5b50\u90f5\u4ef6\u81f3 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">[\u540d\u7a31\u53ca\u96fb\u5b50\u90f5\u4ef6\u5730\u5740]<\/span>\u3002<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>\u6309\u4e00\u4e0b\u4ee5\u4e0b\u6309\u9215\u5373\u8868\u793a\u60a8\u627f\u8a8d\u4ee5\u4e0b\u4e8b\u5b9c\uff1a<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><ul><li>\u60a8\u53c3\u8207\u6b64\u7814\u7a76\u662f\u81ea\u9858\u7684\u3002<\/li><li>\u60a8\u5df2\u5e74\u6eff 18 \u6b72<\/li><li>\u60a8\u77e5\u9053\u81ea\u5df1\u53ef\u4ee5\u5728\u4efb\u4f55\u6642\u9593\u56e0\u4efb\u4f55\u539f\u56e0\u800c\u9078\u64c7\u7d42\u6b62\u53c3\u8207\u7814\u7a76\u3002<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"\u6211\u540c\u610f\uff0c\u958b\u59cb\u8abf\u67e5"},"2":{"Display":"\u6211\u4e0d\u540c\u610f\uff0c\u4e0d\u5e0c\u671b\u53c3\u8207"}}}},"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"informedConsent","QuestionID":"QID4190","QuestionText":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Welcome to the research study! &nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">We are interested in understanding <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">moral decision making in the menstrual cycle<\/span>. For this study, you will be presented with information relevant to <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">moral decision making.<\/span>&nbsp;Then, you will be asked to answer some questions about it. Your responses will be kept completely confidential.\u2028\u2028<br>\n<br>\nThe study should take you around&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">30 minutes<\/span>&nbsp;to complete.&nbsp;You will receive&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">\u00a35<\/span>&nbsp;for your participation.\u2028\u2028 Your participation in this research is voluntary. You have the right to withdraw at any point during the study. The Principal Investigator of this study can be contacted at <a href=\"mailto:briana-taylor.guerrero-sanchez@city.ac.uk\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">briana-taylor.guerrero-sanchez@city.ac.uk<\/span><\/a>.\u2028<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div><br>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">By clicking the button below, you acknowledge:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You are 18 years of age.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You understand that your participation is voluntary and that you are free to withdraw without giving a reason without being penalised or disadvantaged.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You understand that you will be able to withdraw your data up to the time of publication.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You agree to City recording and processing this information about you. You understand that this information will be used only for the purpose(s) explained in the participant information and my consent is conditional on City complying with its duties and obligations under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You confirm that you have read and understood the participant information dated 08\/07\/24 (Version 1.0) for the above study. You have had the opportunity to consider the information and ask questions which have been answered satisfactorily.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You&nbsp;agree to take part in the above study.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<div><br>\n&nbsp;<\/div>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Welcome to the research study! &nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">We are interested in understanding <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">moral decision making in the menstrual cycle<\/span>. For this study, you will be presented with information relevant to <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">moral decision making.<\/span>&nbsp;Then, you will be asked to answer some questions about it. Your responses will be kept completely confidential.\u2028\u2028<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThe study should take you around&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">30 minutes<\/span>&nbsp;to complete.&nbsp;You will receive&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">&pound;5<\/span>&nbsp;for your participation.\u2028\u2028 Your participation in this research is voluntary. You have the right to withdraw at any point during the study. The Principal Investigator of this study can be contacted at <a href=\"mailto:briana-taylor.guerrero-sanchez@city.ac.uk\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">briana-taylor.guerrero-sanchez@city.ac.uk<\/span><\/a>.\u2028<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">By clicking the button below, you acknowledge:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You are 18 years of age.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You understand that your participation is voluntary and that you are free to withdraw without giving a reason without being penalised or disadvantaged.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You understand that you will be able to withdraw your data up to the time of publication.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You agree to City recording and processing this information about you. You understand that this information will be used only for the purpose(s) explained in the participant information and my consent is conditional on City complying with its duties and obligations under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You confirm that you have read and understood the participant information dated 08\/07\/24 (Version 1.0) for the above study. You have had the opportunity to consider the information and ask questions which have been answered satisfactorily.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You&nbsp;agree to take part in the above study.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<div><br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/div>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"CustomValidation","CustomValidation":{"Logic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID172807553\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span><span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Welcome to the research study! &amp;nbsp;\n\n&amp;nbsp;\n\nWe are interested in understanding moral decision making in the menstrual cycle. For this study, you will be presented with information relevant to mo...<\/span><span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">I consent, begin the study<\/span><span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span>","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID172807553\/SelectableChoice\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID172807553","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID172807553","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression"},"Message":{"description":"no consent","libraryID":"UR_9tSjviAwxy33W9U","messageID":"MS_2oD0n04rslZRLj8","subMessageID":"VE_CUSTOM_VALIDATION_0"}}}}}},
