{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4189","SecondaryAttribute":"PIS","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"PIS","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":9,"QuestionDescription":"PIS","QuestionID":"QID4189","QuestionText":"<title><\/title>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">PARTICIPANT INFORMATION SHEET<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h1>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">ETH2324-2295 (08\/07\/24 Version 1.0)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Title of study: Moral Decision Making in the Menstrual Cycle<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Name of principal investigator\/researcher: Briana Guerrero-Sanchez &amp; Dr. Ansgar Endress<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">We would like to invite you to take part in a research study. Before you decide whether you would like to take part it is important that you understand why the research is being done and what it would involve for you. Please take time to read the following information carefully and discuss it with others if you wish. You can <\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/cityunilondon.eu.qualtrics.com\/CP\/File.php?F=F_3sGpaEp4yvUjJd4\" target=\"_blank\">download\/save<\/a> \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">the information sheet to keep.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">What is the purpose of the study?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">We are interested in how phases of the menstrual cycle influence how people make moral decisions.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Why have I been invited to take part?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You are invited because you expressed interest in the study.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Do I have to take part?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Participation in the project is voluntary, and you can choose not to participate in part or all of the project. You can withdraw at any stage of the project without being penalised or disadvantaged in any way, simply by closing your browser window. It is up to you to decide whether or not to take part. If you do decide to take part, you will be asked to sign a consent form. If you decide to take part, you are still free to withdraw at any time and without giving a reason. However, once you have finished the study, you can no longer withdraw your data. This is because the study is anonymous, and we do not know which data is yours.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">What will happen if I take part?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">This study will be conducted online on Qualtrics and will take about 30 minutes. You will be asked some background questions about yourself and complete a few personality questionnaires related to sensation-seeking, impulsivity, and your connection to humanity. After that, you will be presented with a series of written, hypothetical scenarios. In these scenarios, you will be asked to indicate if you are willing to sacrifice a fewer number of people to save the lives of a larger number of people.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">What are the possible disadvantages and risks of taking part?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">We do not anticipate any risks from participating in this study. However, you might feel upset when making hypothetical decisions about sacrificing people. If you believe this could affect you, we recommend that you refrain from participating in this study.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">What are the possible benefits of taking part?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Besides helping us to better understand how the menstrual cycle affects how you make decisions, there are no benefits for you to take part in the study.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Expenses and Payments<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You will be paid $5 for your time.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">How is the project being funded?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">The study is funded by City, University of London.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Conflicts of interests<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">There are no conflicts of interest.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">What should I do if I want to take part?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">To take part, simply follow the links.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Will my taking part in the study be kept confidential?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Yes. We will not collect any personal data. Anonymous data may be shared with data repositories. These are websites where researchers share data for reanalysis, verification, and reuse. The anonymous data will be retained indefinitely.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">What will happen to the results?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">We aim to publish the results in a specialist journal as well as an MSc dissertation. We will not send you a copy and will not keep you posted about the results or the progress of the project, simply because we have no way to contact you.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Who has reviewed the study?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">This study has been approved by City, University of London, Psychology Research Ethics Committee.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">What if there is a problem?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">If you have any problems, concerns or questions about this study, you should ask to speak to a member of the research team. If you remain unhappy and wish to complain formally, you can do this through City&rsquo;s complaints procedure. To complain about the study, you need to phone 020 7040 3040. You can then ask to speak to the Secretary to Senate Research Ethics Committee and inform them that the name of the project is Moral Decision Making in the Menstrual Cycle.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You can also write to the Secretary at:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Annah Whyton<br \/>\nResearch &amp; Enterprise Office<br \/>\nCity, University of London<br \/>\nNorthampton Square<br \/>\nLondon, EC1V 0HB<br \/>\nEmail: <\/span><a href=\"mailto:senaterec@city.ac.uk\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">senaterec@city.ac.uk<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Further information and contact details:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Contact Briana Guerrero-Sanchez (<\/span><a href=\"mailto:briana-taylor.guerrero-sanchez@city.ac.uk\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">briana-taylor.guerrero-sanchez@city.ac.uk<\/span><\/a><span style=\"color:#000000;\">) or Dr Ansgar Endress (<\/span><a href=\"mailto:Ansgar.endress.1@city.ac.uk\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">Ansgar.endress.1@city.ac.uk<\/span><\/a><span style=\"color:#000000;\">), if you have any questions or concerns.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Thank you for taking the time to read this information sheet.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<title><\/title>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">PARTICIPANT INFORMATION SHEET<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h1>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">ETH2324-2295 (08\/07\/24 Version 1.0)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Title of study: Moral Decision Making in the Menstrual Cycle<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Name of principal investigator\/researcher: Briana Guerrero-Sanchez &amp; Dr. Ansgar Endress<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">We would like to invite you to take part in a research study. Before you decide whether you would like to take part it is important that you understand why the research is being done and what it would involve for you. Please take time to read the following information carefully and discuss it with others if you wish. You can <\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/cityunilondon.eu.qualtrics.com\/CP\/File.php?F=F_3sGpaEp4yvUjJd4\" target=\"_blank\">download\/save<\/a> \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">the information sheet to keep.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">What is the purpose of the study?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">We are interested in how phases of the menstrual cycle influence how people make moral decisions.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Why have I been invited to take part?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You are invited because you expressed interest in the study.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Do I have to take part?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Participation in the project is voluntary, and you can choose not to participate in part or all of the project. You can withdraw at any stage of the project without being penalised or disadvantaged in any way, simply by closing your browser window. It is up to you to decide whether or not to take part. If you do decide to take part, you will be asked to sign a consent form. If you decide to take part, you are still free to withdraw at any time and without giving a reason. However, once you have finished the study, you can no longer withdraw your data. This is because the study is anonymous, and we do not know which data is yours.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">What will happen if I take part?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">This study will be conducted online on Qualtrics and will take about 30 minutes. You will be asked some background questions about yourself and complete a few personality questionnaires related to sensation-seeking, impulsivity, and your connection to humanity. After that, you will be presented with a series of written, hypothetical scenarios. In these scenarios, you will be asked to indicate if you are willing to sacrifice a fewer number of people to save the lives of a larger number of people.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">What are the possible disadvantages and risks of taking part?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">We do not anticipate any risks from participating in this study. However, you might feel upset when making hypothetical decisions about sacrificing people. If you believe this could affect you, we recommend that you refrain from participating in this study.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">What are the possible benefits of taking part?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Besides helping us to better understand how the menstrual cycle affects how you make decisions, there are no benefits for you to take part in the study.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Expenses and Payments<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You will be paid $5 for your time.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">How is the project being funded?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">The study is funded by City, University of London.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Conflicts of interests<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">There are no conflicts of interest.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">What should I do if I want to take part?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">To take part, simply follow the links.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Will my taking part in the study be kept confidential?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Yes. We will not collect any personal data. Anonymous data may be shared with data repositories. These are websites where researchers share data for reanalysis, verification, and reuse. The anonymous data will be retained indefinitely.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">What will happen to the results?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">We aim to publish the results in a specialist journal as well as an MSc dissertation. We will not send you a copy and will not keep you posted about the results or the progress of the project, simply because we have no way to contact you.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Who has reviewed the study?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">This study has been approved by City, University of London, Psychology Research Ethics Committee.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">What if there is a problem?<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">If you have any problems, concerns or questions about this study, you should ask to speak to a member of the research team. If you remain unhappy and wish to complain formally, you can do this through City&rsquo;s complaints procedure. To complain about the study, you need to phone 020 7040 3040. You can then ask to speak to the Secretary to Senate Research Ethics Committee and inform them that the name of the project is Moral Decision Making in the Menstrual Cycle.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You can also write to the Secretary at:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Annah Whyton<br \/>\nResearch &amp; Enterprise Office<br \/>\nCity, University of London<br \/>\nNorthampton Square<br \/>\nLondon, EC1V 0HB<br \/>\nEmail: <\/span><a href=\"mailto:senaterec@city.ac.uk\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">senaterec@city.ac.uk<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<h3><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Further information and contact details:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Contact Briana Guerrero-Sanchez (<\/span><a href=\"mailto:briana-taylor.guerrero-sanchez@city.ac.uk\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">briana-taylor.guerrero-sanchez@city.ac.uk<\/span><\/a><span style=\"color:#000000;\">) or Dr Ansgar Endress (<\/span><a href=\"mailto:Ansgar.endress.1@city.ac.uk\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">Ansgar.endress.1@city.ac.uk<\/span><\/a><span style=\"color:#000000;\">), if you have any questions or concerns.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><br \/>\n<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Thank you for taking the time to read this information sheet.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID105","SecondaryAttribute":"Please enter your age.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Please enter your age.","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"SL","QuestionDescription":"Please enter your age.","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"$option.ForceResponseType","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"ContentType","ContentType":"ValidNumber","ValidDateType":"DateWithFormat","ValidPhoneType":"ValidUSPhone","ValidZipType":"ValidUSZip","ValidNumber":{"Min":"18","Max":"99","NumDecimals":"0"}}},"Language":[],"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Please enter your age.","DataExportTag":"age","QuestionID":"QID105"}},
