{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4196","SecondaryAttribute":"SSS_Directions","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"SSS_Directions ","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":9,"QuestionDescription":"SSS_Directions","QuestionID":"QID4196","QuestionText":"In the following task, you will be provided with two choices, A and B. Please select the letter of the choice which most describes your likes or the way you feel. If both options describe your likes or feelings, choose the one that fits best. If you do not like either option, pick the one you dislike the least.&nbsp;<br><br>We are interested only in your likes or feelings, not in how others feel about these things or how one is supposed to feel. There are not right or wrong answers. Be frank and give your honest appraisal of yourself.","QuestionText_Unsafe":"In the following task, you will be provided with two choices, A and B. Please select the letter of the choice which most describes your likes or the way you feel. If both options describe your likes or feelings, choose the one that fits best. If you do not like either option, pick the one you dislike the least.&nbsp;<br><br>We are interested only in your likes or feelings, not in how others feel about these things or how one is supposed to feel. There are not right or wrong answers. Be frank and give your honest appraisal of yourself.","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4230","SecondaryAttribute":"SSS_Q34_insultOthers","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"A. I like people who are sharp and witty even if they do sometimes insult others."},"2":{"Display":"B. I dislike people who have their fun at the expense of hurting the feelings of others."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel"},"DataExportTag":"SSS_insultOthers","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"SSS_Q34_insultOthers","QuestionID":"QID4230","QuestionText":"Choose either A or B.","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Choose either A or B.","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID103","SecondaryAttribute":"Thank you for taking part in this study.\u00a0Our research team at City, University of London is inter..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"text-align: left;\">Thank you for taking part in this study.&nbsp;Our research team at City, University of London is interested in learning what people think about difficult situations and how to act in these situations. We would like to learn from your personal thoughts.<\/div>\n\n<p><o:p><\/o:p><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Thank you for taking part in this study.\u00a0Our research team at City, University of London is inter...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":11,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div style=\"text-align: left;\">Thank you for taking part in this study.&nbsp;Our research team at City, University of London is interested in learning what people think about difficult situations and how to act in these situations. We would like to learn from your personal thoughts.<\/div>\n\n<p><o:p><\/o:p><\/p>","DataExportTag":"Q103","QuestionID":"QID103"}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3615","SecondaryAttribute":"Toxic factory A fire in a chemical factory threatens to release heptahopretyde, a gas that kills...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Toxic factory<\/b><br><br>\n\nA fire in a chemical factory threatens to release heptahopretyde, a gas that kills within seconds even in minimal doses. If released, everybody in the immediately surrounding area will be killed, though the factory workers themselves will be fine due to their respiratory equipment.\n<br> <br>\nThe firefighters can prevent the release of heptahopretyde by using heavy lift helicopters to drop a containment tent over the building that concentrates and then purifies the gases. This will save 5,000 people in the surrounding area. However, this will overwhelm the respiratory equipment of 100 workers in the factory and will kill them due to heptahopretyde exposure.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.toxicFactory.neutral.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.5000.n_total.5100.n_victims.100.ratio_saved_victims.50.text","QuestionID":"QID3615","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Toxic factory A fire in a chemical factory threatens to release heptahopretyde, a gas that kills...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3639","SecondaryAttribute":"Toxic factory A fire in a chemical factory threatens to release heptahopretyde, a gas that kills...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Toxic factory<\/b><br><br>\n\nA fire in a chemical factory threatens to release heptahopretyde, a gas that kills within seconds even in minimal doses. If released, everybody in the immediately surrounding area will be killed, though the factory workers themselves will be fine due to their respiratory equipment.\n<br> <br>\nThe firefighters can prevent the release of heptahopretyde by using heavy lift helicopters to drop a containment tent over the building that concentrates and then purifies the gases. This will save 40 people in the surrounding area. However, this will overwhelm the respiratory equipment of 20 workers in the factory and will kill them due to heptahopretyde exposure.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.toxicFactory.neutral.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.40.n_total.600.n_victims.20.ratio_saved_victims.2.text","QuestionID":"QID3639","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Toxic factory A fire in a chemical factory threatens to release heptahopretyde, a gas that kills...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_9MHtNAQuGij1DTg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3663","SecondaryAttribute":"Toxic factory A fire in a chemical factory threatens to release heptahopretyde, a gas that kills...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Toxic factory<\/b><br><br>\n\nA fire in a chemical factory threatens to release heptahopretyde, a gas that kills within seconds even in minimal doses. If released, everybody in the immediately surrounding area will be killed, though the factory workers themselves will be fine due to their respiratory equipment.\n<br> <br>\nThe firefighters can prevent the release of heptahopretyde by using heavy lift helicopters to drop a containment tent over the building that concentrates and then purifies the gases. This will save 30 people in the surrounding area. However, this will overwhelm the respiratory equipment of 10 workers in the factory and will kill them due to heptahopretyde exposure.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.toxicFactory.neutral.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.30.n_total.40.n_victims.10.ratio_saved_victims.3.text","QuestionID":"QID3663","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Toxic factory A fire in a chemical factory threatens to release heptahopretyde, a gas that kills...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
